                "location": {
                  "line": 60
                },
                "text": "For more details, visit: CloudWay24.com/baggage (https://CloudWay24.com/baggage)"
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "location": {
                  "line": 62
                },
                "text": "Thank you for choosing CloudWay 24. We’re committed to resolving your baggage concerns as quickly as possible!"
